{"3800010": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Abyssal Rust", "steam_appid": 3800010, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "controller_support": "full", "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unknown Depths</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The newly discovered ocean planet Xyphos-6 hides extremely valuable artifacts and resources in its deep waters, for the brave or the foolish enough to venture there.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800010/extras/8ea88593a3b43770ca2e926b2159becd.poster.avif?t=1785966289\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800010/extras/8ea88593a3b43770ca2e926b2159becd.webm?t=1785966289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800010/extras/8ea88593a3b43770ca2e926b2159becd.mp4?t=1785966289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Deep Ocean Exploration</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The depths are yours to explore, as long as your submarine doesn’t collapse under the pressure… or from something else.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800010/extras/75fd2a1a93c1939e634542a874ea4499.poster.avif?t=1785966289\" width=480 height=270 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800010/extras/75fd2a1a93c1939e634542a874ea4499.webm?t=1785966289\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3800010/extras/75fd2a1a93c1939e634542a874ea4499.mp4?t=1785966289\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"b